WEBVTT

00:01:26.988 --> 00:01:30.948
And what if I told you
that it's actually killing more people

00:01:30.972 --> 00:01:33.480
than we thought
to be the case ever before?

00:01:33.956 --> 00:01:35.234
That's true, too.

00:01:36.903 --> 00:01:40.990
Smoking kills more people each year
than alcohol, AIDS, car accidents,

00:01:41.014 --> 00:01:44.196
illegal drugs, murders
and suicides combined.

00:01:45.154 --> 00:01:46.554
Year in and year out.

00:01:47.979 --> 00:01:49.874
In 2014,

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.871
Dr. Adams's predecessor released

00:01:52.895 --> 00:01:55.315
the 50th anniversary
Surgeon General's report

00:01:55.339 --> 00:01:56.806
on smoking and health.

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:01.863
And that report upped the annual
death toll from smoking,